cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Causalix.AI: LLM-based Causal Loop Diagram Building and Validation"
abstract: >-
  A semi-autonomous LLM-based system for building Causal Loop Diagrams (CLDs)
  from scientific literature. This repository contains the platform code,
  experimental pipelines, and thesis research on LLM-as-Judge hallucination
  detection in scientific knowledge synthesis.
authors:
